{"_v":1,"id":"showstopper-the-improvised-musical-west-end-2023","bd":{"positive":3,"mixed":1,"negative":1},"rv":[{"cn":"Dominic Cavendish","o":"The Telegraph","s":82,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.telegraph.co.uk/theatre/what-to-see/showstopper-the-improvised-musical-review/","d":"2015-10-01","q":"Although the set could hardly be skimpier...this is impro with the full accent on pro: top-dollar amusement that doesn’t let up from frisky, low-key start to standing ovation-inducing finish."},{"cn":"Fiona Mountford","o":"Evening Standard","s":50,"b":"Negative","t":1,"u":"https://www.standard.co.uk/culture/theatre/showstopper-the-improvised-musical-review-audience-make-this-off-the-cuff-show-sing-with-illicit-romance-a4047516.html","d":"2019-01-24","q":"At the finale everyone was clapping and singing along and I left humming happily."},{"cn":"Sophie Thomas","o":"London Theatre","s":78,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.londontheatre.co.uk/reviews/review-showstoppers-the-improvised-musical-celebrates-1000-performances-at-the-other-palace","d":"2019-01-24","q":"The Showstoppers have managed to find their niche in a crowded theatrical market."},{"cn":"Gillian Orr","o":"The Independent","s":76,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.independent.co.uk/arts-entertainment/theatre-dance/showstopper-the-improvised-musical-it-s-like-singing-a-song-without-knowing-where-it-is-heading-a6695901.html","q":"Either way, they certainly know how to put on a show."},{"cn":"Paul Vale","o":"The Stage","s":68,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"https://www.thestage.co.uk/reviews/showstopper-the-improvised-musical-review-at-the-other-palace-london--hugely-entertaining","d":"2019-01-23","q":"The book, music and lyrics may not be hugely sophisticated but the choruses are catchy."}],"au":{"score":79,"designation":"Liking","sources":{"mz":{"s":79,"c":190,"sr":4}}},"hi":"https://images.ctfassets.net/6pezt69ih962/1MGjJ0p9IV5IuqSd0nscTR/ac411ad8b05e31225f347fe7723c513d/Showstopper__The_Improvised_Musical_-